From 7b6891d4d428187d53c466d5261599cd797b4eb2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paavo <Shikuloph1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:41:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix demo bugs found in a live run-through
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- server: a malformed URL (e.g. /%E0%A4%A) threw in decodeURIComponent and
  crashed the server; now answers 400. Unexpected handler errors return 500
  instead of killing the process. Tighter static-path check.
- pricing: the fare's time component used the jittered live traffic, so the
  price on the options screen drifted a few cents before Request. It now uses
  the demand level's base traffic: the quote shown is exactly what is charged.
  ETAs still follow live traffic.
- driver app: a guest booked via "Someone else" was shown as "Verified" with
  the booker's rating. Now shows "Guest · booked by <name> (verified)".
- sample guest renamed from "Meme Ndapandula" (Meme is a title, so the app
  called her "Meme") to "Ndapandula Shikongo".
- background demo driver renamed Rauna Shilongo / N 9090 W -> Hilma Nangolo /
  N 6152 W so "Apply to drive -> Fill sample details" no longer creates a
  second driver with the same name and plate.
- panel log: "acceptance 55.00000000000001%" -> "55%".
- ride ids HR-xxxx (old name Hera) -> FU-xxxx; package.json name/description.
- root README explaining demo/, rider_app/ and ride-hailing-backend/.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ei8RspsGUmtoSL5MBkKnDr
